 "buy_basket_note": "`buy_basket` is the tracker status and does NOT apply clause (f) (hack4/hack6); `buy_with_clause_f` is the same screen minus past winners (hack3). The DIFFERENCE between them is what clause (f) bought or cost -- which is the only way to answer 'do not buy last year's winner' rather than assume it.",
